<ordering_principle>
Follow **execution flow** from entry point to data layer:
- **Layer 1 - Entry**: Controller/API/Router/GraphQL Resolver
- **Layer 2 - Logic**: Service/Context/UseCase/CommandHandler
- **Layer 3 - Data**: Repository/Query/DataAccess/Gateway
- **Layer 4 - Model**: Schema/Entity/Type/Contract
- Tests follow the code they test
</ordering_principle>

