<action id="2E">
<title>REFUSAL_CHECK</title>
<description>**CRITICAL: Default to asking questions - skip only when truly no decision exists**</description>
<skip_criteria>
Before posing questions, verify this file has NO decision points.

**Skip question ONLY if ALL of the following are true:**
- No conditional logic (if/else/switch) found in the code snippet
- No data transformation or business logic
- No security-sensitive operations
- No review warnings flagged for this file
- File is purely declarative (schema, types, constants)
- No architectural pattern choices visible
</skip_criteria>
<frequency_expectation>
- Most files should have at least ONE question
- Questions validate understanding of WHY decisions were made
- Even simple files have architectural context worth validating
- When in doubt, ASK - user can always respond "Skip"
</frequency_expectation>
<skip_output>
```
